extraction_notes: "Rifts World Book 29: Madhaven printed 32-35 (cache p033-p036); XP ladder ''Gateway Knight O.C.C. & Mutant Shaman R.C.C.'', printed 79. The bonded spells are granted by catalog name at the catalog''s own cost; the book''s reduced costs are recorded in the Bond ability and not stored. ''Re-Open Gateway/Rift'' is the catalog''s Re-Open Gateway, and ''Sense Magic Dimensional Anomaly (4)'' is Sense Dimensional Anomaly (4 I.S.P.). The book''s ''save vs magic'' is stored as both spell_magic and ritual_magic. The Spd bonus is rolled and is prose. The White Rose healing items (four petals, three leaves, two healing potions) are stored as starting equipment. The Teleportation abilities are prose. The D-Bee share of Gateways is printed as ''20'' without a percent sign; the body keeps that figure as printed. occ_group magic: the Gateway is a Mystic Knight, which printed 28 files among the magic O.C.C.s."
